            "review_text": "LosPollos81\n6 contributions\n0\nIdeal place for feeding dogs\nDec 2024 • Friends\nAHHHHHRHHHHH....I need to start with the positif. The service is very good and the waitress are very kind \nBut about the dishes...that's the worst of the worst. My stomac is completly destroy. The piece of chicken and the fried dishes are probably cooked last week, or maybe last mouth. No joke, if I gave this chicken to my dog, I’d have to pour milk into his bowl to help him chew it properly.\nUnacceptable.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nRun for your health\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 26, 2025",
