            "review_title": "Review at Dookki Vietnam",
            "review_text": "Karmia L\n1 contribution\n0\nReally good\nJun 2020\nThe price is really afforable (139,000 VND, not included VAT). Although the price is cheap, it had enough food options. There's cheese tteok, normal tteok, taro tteok, etc. And there's also ramen, sushi, and veggies. I really liked the seasoned chicken. It was super crunchy and delicious. The eating time is just 90 minutes, sounds short but it's enough for everyone to finish their meal. \nAs I went to the restaurant, the waiters immediately introduced about the dishes and poured the soup into the pot for me. All the waiters were very welcoming. They were always there when I need them. \nDookki is really good. Recommed it for everyone !\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten September 6, 2020",
