            "review_text": "AngeloShyTown\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam8 contributions\n0\nForeigners should not eat here due to discriminatation.\nAug 2020 • Family\nIf you're a foreigner do not go here unless you want to be discriminated against. I came with my fiance her little sister and her boyfriend all locals. They tried to set us in the back away from all the other tables because coronavirus is flaring up again they also tried to split up our party of four to two different tables to people eat but saw several other tables with three people for people and one table with even 5 people. They are trying to say that a group of five is okay at a table of four which makes no sense. Dookki buffet you are only as strong as your weakest link, you have many weak links. We hope you enjoy the additional one star star Google review as much as we enjoyed the insulting visit to your place. For the record while I am American I have lived here for almost a year I have been here since before coronavirus you should not profile foreigners because of their skin color and assumed they were playing. If you were educated you would know that there is a travel ban on Vietnam and only Nationals can enter at this time. I guess only educated people would know that.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 6, 2020",
