            "review_text": "Yan Cui Travel\n253 contributions\n0\nYummy tokbokki buffet\nSep 2019 • Family\nThis restaurant has attracted hundreds of diners including my family because of the following reasons:\n- The buffet ticket costs 153,000 vnd (6.6 usd) per adult, included vat; it is so reasonable.\n- There are varieties of Korean dishes such as: kimbab, mixed rice bowl, tokbokki hot pot, fried chicken and snacks, and free soft drinks.\n- Diners can have their own creation for hot pot taste and mixed rice bowl style. Why don't you give it a try? :)\n- The restaurant hygiene is good. Food quality is also good.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 25, 2019",
