            "review_text": "Liliana\n15 contributions\n0\nAmazing food\nMar 2019 • Couples\nI found this restaurant online and went there. This is a Korean buffet restaurant. When we arrived at the restaurant was very crowded so we had to wait a bit.\nWe finally had a table to sit and the staff came to guide us how to use the meal package within 90 minutes. We choose cari sauce with mixed rice, tokbokki and some fried foods. We get enough food because if we waste so much food, the restaurant will charge an extra fee of 40 VND. \nThe sauce is delicious, little bit spicy, the tokbokki is tender and especially I like the french fries. We will definitely comeback.\nRead more\nWritten March 12, 2019",
